# A class typed with an IES4 class. ies:ClassOfAsset is the powerset of ies:Asset, so the typing
# says PassengerShip is a class of asset. It is an IES statement by the author, so the class stays
# a class and the typing is kept and mapped.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ies_top: <http://purl.org/ies/top/v0/ont/> .
@prefix ies_tport: <http://purl.org/ies/tport/v0/ont/> .
@prefix ont: <http://example.com/local-ontology#> .

ont:PassengerShip a rdfs:Class,
        ies_top:SetOfStates ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ies_tport:Ship .
